[21:42:55] [PROCESS] Methodology: CF4 table2 is parsed as fixed-width columns per the CDS ReadMe specification (28 columns, 1-indexed bytes). Distances are derived from the composite distance modulus via d = 10^((DM - 25)/5) Mpc with uncertainty delta_d = e_DM * d * ln(10)/5. Redshift is computed from the CMB-frame velocity as z = Vcmb / c (c = 299792.458 km/s).
